=2 Walkthrough
* Once you accept the assignment, the {n:Task Delegator} will provide you with a {k:Kam. FS building mat. container} to deliver to a Station Administrator in {z:Kamihr Drifts}.
** As of the {p:Feb. 18 2014 Version Update|http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/40059-Feb-18-2014-%28JST%29-Version-Update?p=493165&viewfull=1#post493165}, Waypoints can now be used to complete this task without risk of break. Simply warp to a Station Administrator.
* Head to {z:Kamihr Drifts} and speak to the {n:Station Administrator} to complete the assignment.
* Return to the {n:Task Delegator} to receive your reward (you may use Waypoints again now).

=2 Notes
* {p:http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/40059-Feb-18-2014-%28JST%29-Version-Update?p=493165&viewfull=1#post493165}
* Movement speed increasing effects recommended.
* Completing this assignment presumably aids with the construction of the Frontier Station in {z:Kamihr Drifts}.

